{% comment %}
  ============================================
  SECTION 9 — FAQ
  Whipped Tallow & Honey Balm
  ============================================

  HOW TO USE:
  1. Go to Online Store → Themes → Customize
  2. Add a "Custom Liquid" block on the product page
  3. Paste this entire file into the Custom Liquid box

  NO IMAGE NEEDED

  BRAND COLORS:
  - Primary teal: #2d6b5d
  - Cream bg: #f7f3ed

  MOBILE OPTIMIZED — native HTML details/summary accordion
  ============================================
{% endcomment %}

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  .section-faq {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 48px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    color: #2a2a2a;
  }

  .section-faq__header {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-faq__list {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-faq__item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e0d8;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .section-faq__item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .section-faq__summary {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    padding: 20px 32px 20px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    position: relative;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .section-faq__summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .section-faq__summary:hover {
    color: #2d6b5d;
  }

  .section-faq__summary::after {
    content: '+';
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #2d6b5d;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .section-faq__item[open] .section-faq__summary::after {
    content: '−';
  }

  .section-faq__answer {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #555;
    padding: 0 0 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .section-faq {
      margin: 32px auto;
    }
    .section-faq__header {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .section-faq__summary {
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 18px 30px 18px 0;
    }
    .section-faq__answer {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="section-faq">
  <h2 class="section-faq__header">Still have questions?</h2>

  <div class="section-faq__list">

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">How long does one jar last?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">2-3 months with daily use on face and neck. Longer if you use it only at night. A little goes a long way.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">Can I use this on my body too?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">Yes. Face, neck, hands, elbows, anywhere dry. Many customers use it head to toe.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">Is this safe for sensitive skin?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">Yes. 4 ingredients, no fragrance, no chemicals. Tallow is one of the gentlest balms you can find. If most products cause a reaction, this is worth trying.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">What does it smell like?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">Warm honey with a subtle natural scent. It's not perfumed and it doesn't smell like meat. The manuka honey is the dominant note.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">Will this clog my pores?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">For dry, normal, or mature skin — no. Tallow has a low comedogenic rating. For oily or acne-prone skin, we recommend patch testing first.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">Where is the tallow sourced?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">From grass-fed cattle. The tallow is whipped with manuka honey from New Zealand, cold-pressed olive oil, and calendula flower extract.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">How should I store it?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">Room temperature. It may firm up in cooler weather and soften in warmth — that's completely normal for a natural balm with no synthetic stabilizers.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="section-faq__item">
      <summary class="section-faq__summary">Can I use this with other skincare products?</summary>
      <p class="section-faq__answer">Yes, but most customers find they don't need to. That's kind of the point.</p>
    </details>

  </div>
</section>
